BabelDOC Local Enhanced Fork
============================

This repository is a modified version of BabelDOC:
https://github.com/funstory-ai/BabelDOC

The original work and this derivative version are distributed under the GNU
Affero General Public License, version 3. See LICENSE for the complete terms.
Copyright in the original work remains with its respective copyright holders.

Fork modifications began on 2026-09-10 and include:

- validation and retry handling for empty translation responses;
- safeguards against replacing source paragraphs with empty output;
- compatibility changes for reasoning-capable OpenAI-style APIs;
- translation-length validation appropriate for short Chinese text;
- preservation of author, affiliation, URL, and figure-internal text layouts;
- figure-caption and cross-page translation workflow improvements;
- no-watermark output by default; and
- local source installation and private TOML configuration documentation.

Files changed from the original work carry a short modification notice and
refer to this file. Newly added files form part of the same AGPL-3.0-covered
work. No additional noncommercial restriction is imposed.
